! PLAYER~TURNONANSI

Turns ANSI back on through the shared player prompt path.

''Include:'' [[player.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/player.ts:1187`

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
#-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
send &quot;c n&quot;
killalltriggers
waiton &quot;(1) ANSI graphics&quot;
getword CURRENTLINE $PLAYER~ANSISTATUS 5
if ($PLAYER~ANSISTATUS = &quot;Off&quot;)
  send &quot;1 q q&quot;
else
</pre>

